{
    "background_story": "Ivan was a skilled surgeon who had seen his fair share of battle-scarred patients during his time as a medic in the war-torn country. But nothing could have prepared him for the fateful night that would leave his scrubs bloodstained and his conscience forever changed. As he rushed to save the life of a young rebel fighter, he was caught in the crossfire and gravely injured. Despite his own wounds, Ivan managed to stabilize the patient and save his life. The incident left Ivan with physical and emotional scars, but also a newfound sense of purpose. He dedicated his life to providing medical aid to those affected by conflict, often putting himself in harm's way to save others. Ivan's bloodstained past became a catalyst for his selfless work, earning him the respect and admiration of his peers.",
